  "body": "$\\log_3 2=a$, $\\log_5 3=b$일 때, $\\log_{240}90$을 $a$, $b$에 대한 식으로 나타내시오.",
  "choices": [],
  "answer": "$\\dfrac{ab+2b+1}{4ab+b+1}$",
  "figure": null,
  "solution": "$\\log_3 2=a$, $\\log_3 5=\\dfrac1{\\log_5 3}=\\dfrac1b$이므로\n$$\\log_{240}90=\\dfrac{\\log_3 90}{\\log_3 240}=\\dfrac{\\log_3(2\\cdot3^2\\cdot5)}{\\log_3(2^4\\cdot3\\cdot5)}$$\n$$=\\dfrac{\\log_3 2+2\\log_3 3+\\log_3 5}{4\\log_3 2+\\log_3 3+\\log_3 5}$$\n$$=\\dfrac{a+2+\\dfrac1b}{4a+1+\\dfrac1b}=\\dfrac{ab+2b+1}{4ab+b+1}$$이다.",
